  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp",
  "published": "2026-06-28T20:46:31.383Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0 adds more cluster reads - GetVoteAccountsAsync, GetInflationRewardAsync, GetLeaderScheduleAsync, GetBlocksAsync and GetClusterNodesAsync - plus a jsonParsed account path: GetParsedAccountInfoAsync and SubscribeParsedAccountAsync, decoding a recognized account to a typed Parsed view and falling back to raw bytes when the owning program is unknown. Follows semantic versioning; while on 0.x, minor releases may carry breaking changes. Changelog: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
